<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on UK property basket.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on UK property basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued two million American-style call warrants, on a UK property basket comprising Greycoat Properties Plc, Chesterfield Properties Plc, Capital &amp; Regional Properties Plc and Hemingway Properties Plc, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    5.4703 GBP		PREMIUM	116.60 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.6054 GBP		GEARING	8.60 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   10.AUG.98		 PAYDATE	17.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  5.2098 GBP</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
